ontrol navigation.\n\nLet\u0027s add F6 and Shift+F6 to cycle focus in either direction, highlight\nthe active area and document the shortcuts in the UI and user guide.\nKeep focus traversal in a dedicated class and separate window setup\ninto named steps to maintain a single level of abstraction.\n\nCover traversal, wrapping, descendants and unrelated keys with tests.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":163,"deletions":3},"docs":{"insertions":13,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":114,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"72ce850999a57bcd7766a5734ec6d8ad251a338a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add persistent GUI color scheme selection","messageBody":"The GUI offers only a dark palette, preventing users from choosing a\nscheme that suits their reading preferences.\n\nLet\u0027s add light and dark choices to the View menu and remember the\nselection between launches. Apply a shared palette to the main window,\nHelp window and alerts while preserving command input and window size.\n\nKeep older preference files compatible by defaulting to dark, and cover\npalette switching and preference persistence with tests.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":281,"deletions":77},"docs":{"insertions":10,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":60,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"b115e8ff72ea7c4731e0fa2b106698e59f13ac74","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Support missing timestamps in older contact files","messageBody":"Older files fail to load without createdAt. Use a stable fallback\nwhile retaining validation of existing data.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":53,"deletions":17},"docs":{"insertions":12,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":38,"deletions":15}}},{"hash":"45a54ebead7f15b9af1f3aa4cb62e64a3ef301f6","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Support missing timestamps in older contact files","messageBody":"Older files fail to load without createdAt. Use a stable fallback\nwhile retain